{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-05-15-its-not-just-about-sales-md-4b7704580a:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "For the ease of it, I'm gonna take the example of someone who is interested to invest, which is literally probably eighty percent of the clients, who's potentially looking for offline or ready projects.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-05-15-its-not-just-about-sales-md-4b7704580a:u000004"}], "text": "For Dubai real estate, the client journey usually involves potential clients interested in investing in offline or ready projects, which encompasses about eighty percent of clients."}, "title": "Dubai Real Estate Client Journey Example", "topic": "client_journey"}, "content_hash": "74f48f85ca5fddcfc1637dc9f4fb76acff2904aec6a45f3c1773da047ad5e269", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-05-15-its-not-just-about-sales-md-4b7704580a:knowledge:fa83d4c1a3b25c0c", "metadata_hash": "0428ace5ac721cddcbfc311e963624067a1ed52f3e25d0aef1dca481dce02d7e", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-15T10:42:13Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "8726b55cd609fe708280c20f373e4a356ca719ab788e5ecbcfe7665011a3da58", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-05-15-its-not-just-about-sales-md-4b7704580a", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DYWziEHjwaM/", "title": "Dubai Real Estate Client Journey Example", "topic": "client_journey", "topic_slug": "client_journey"}
